About The Job

**TalentPartners** is actively hiring a CAD Designer (OSP Fiber) for an established Engineering firm that is rapidly growing due to BEAD funding. This is a full-time direct hire position. The designer will be primarily focused on Fiber to the Home design projects, and reporting directly to the Design Lead for day-to-day tasks and project direction.

**Role Title:** CAD Designer (OSP Fiber)

**Location:** Raleigh-Durham, NC (On-Site)

**Salary Range:** $60,000 - $75,000

**Employment Type:** Full-time Direct Hire

**Job Responsibilities:**
• Create and revise CAD designs for Fiber to the Home (FTTH) projects.
• Work directly with the project manager and field engineers to complete designs.
• Follow company standards and guidelines for design quality.
• Develop and maintain accurate construction documents.
• Provide quality review of other team members' work.

**Job Requirements:**

* 2-3 years of OSP Fiber design experience
* Proficiency in AutoCAD or MicroStation
* Experience with FTTH/FTTX (preferred)
* Knowledge of construction drawings and as-builts
* Ability to work both independently and in a team environment

**About TalentPartners:**
TalentPartners is a professional services staffing and recruiting firm that specializes in the telecommunications industry. We are known for our industry specific expertise, consultative approach, and quality of candidates we provide to our clients.

**Disclosure:** TalentPartners recruits on behalf of our clients. When applying to this position, you understand your resume and application will be shared with the client(s) for consideration.

